(20: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%20The%20default%20parse%20of%20a%20language%20whose%20catalog%20grammar%20is%20a%20native%20Links%0A%2F%2F%20Notation%20grammar%20%28the%20catalog%27s%20%60nativeGrammars%60%29%3A%20the%20grammar%20runs%20on%20the%0A%2F%2F%20native%20executor%20with%20automatic%20error%20recovery%2C%20and%20its%20tree%20is%20projected%20as%0A%2F%2F%20the%20language%27s%20tree-sitter%20oracle%20%28the%20catalog%27s%20%60oracleGrammars%60%29%20places%0A%2F%2F%20nodes%2C%20so%20the%20default%20concrete%20syntax%20tree%20keeps%20its%20shape%20when%20the%20native%0A%2F%2F%20grammar%20replaces%20the%20oracle.%20js%2Fscripts%2Fnative-grammar-rows.mjs%20projects%20the%0A%2F%2F%20same%20trees%20to%20fixture%20rows%2C%20and%20rust%2Fsrc%2Fnative_grammar_parser.rs%20is%20the%0A%2F%2F%20Rust%20port.%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20Whitespace%20trivia%20is%20not%20a%20node%2C%20named%20trivia%20%28a%20comment%20token%29%20is%20an%20extra%0A%2F%2F%20node%2C%20leading%20trivia%20belongs%20before%20the%20node%20it%20precedes%2C%20a%20node%20spans%20its%0A%2F%2F%20first%20to%20last%20non-trivia%20leaf%2C%20and%20the%20root%20starts%20at%20its%20first%20leaf%20that%20is%0A%2F%2F%20not%20whitespace%20and%20ends%20at%20the%20end%20of%20the%20input.%20A%20catalog%20entry%20whose%20root%0A%2F%2F%20includes%20leading%20trivia%20retains%20the%20native%20tree%27s%20input%20start%20instead.%0A%2F%2F%20Kinds%20in%20%60hidden%60%20are%0A%2F%2F%20leaves%20the%20oracle%20drops%2C%20such%20as%20a%20byte%20order%20mark%2C%20and%20kinds%20in%0A%2F%2F%20%60anonymous%60%20are%20leaves%20the%20oracle%20keeps%20inside%20a%20node%20without%20a%20node%20of%0A%2F%2F%20their%20own%3B%20the%20text%20of%20both%20is%20the%20gap%20text%20between%20nodes.%20Node%20kinds%20in%0A%2F%2F%20%60extras%60%20are%20extra%20nodes%2C%20as%20the%20oracle%20marks%20a%20comment%20node%20it%20parses%20as%20an%0A%2F%2F%20extra.%20A%20rule%20renamed%20from%20its%20tree-sitter%20name%20keeps%20that%20name%20as%20its%20node%0A%2F%2F%20kind%20%28%60oracleKinds%60%2C%20from%20the%20rule%27s%20%60%28source-names%20%28tree-sitter%20NAME%29%29%60%29.%0A%2F%2F%20A%20kind%20%60%27TEXT%60%2C%20an%20imported%20anonymous%20alias%2C%20is%20an%20anonymous%20node%20TEXT.%0A%2F%2F%20An%20ERROR%20leaf%20is%20a%20named%20%60ERROR%60%20node%20and%20a%20MISSING%20leaf%20an%20empty%0A%2F%2F%20MISSING%20node%2C%20named%20unless%20it%20stands%20for%20a%20literal%3B%20a%20MISSING%20leaf%20of%20no%0A%2F%2F%20kind%20is%20a%20named%20%60MISSING%60%20node.%0Aimport%20%7B%20readFileSync%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Afs%27%3B%0A%0Aimport%20%7B%20compileGrammar%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fgrammar.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20parseGrammarLinks%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fgrammar-links.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20LANGUAGE_CATALOG%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Flanguage-catalog.js%27%3B%0A%0Aconst%20NATIVE_GRAMMARS%20%3D%20LANGUAGE_CATALOG.nativeGrammars%20%3F%3F%20%7B%7D%3B%0Aconst%20PARSERS%20%3D%20new%20Map%28%29%3B%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Whether%20the%20grammar%20id%20%60id%60%20names%20a%20native%20grammar%20of%20the%20catalog.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20isNativeGrammar%28id%29%20%7B%0A%20%20return%20Object.hasOwn%28NATIVE_GRAMMARS%2C%20id%29%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20The%20Links%20Notation%20text%20of%20the%20native%20grammar%20%60id%60.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20nativeGrammarText%28id%29%20%7B%0A%20%20return%20readFileSync%28new%20URL%28%60.%2Fdata%2F%24%7BNATIVE_GRAMMARS%5Bid%5D.file%7D%60%2C%20import.meta.url%29%2C%20%27utf8%27%29%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Each%20native%20grammar%20is%20compiled%20on%20its%20first%20use%20and%20kept%20for%20the%20process.%0Afunction%20nativeParser%28id%29%20%7B%0A%20%20let%20parser%20%3D%20PARSERS.get%28id%29%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28%21parser%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20parser%20%3D%20compileGrammar%28parseGrammarLinks%28nativeGrammarText%28id%29%29%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20PARSERS.set%28id%2C%20parser%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20return%20parser%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%0A%20%2A%20Parses%